    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are adept at hiding yourself from Force-users, thanks to the haze of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Dark_Side\" title=\"The Dark Side\">The Dark Side</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> 1+</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can add one-half your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> (Minimum 1) to any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks made to resist attempts to detect you with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sense_Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sense Force\">Sense Force</a> application of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> skill.</p>",
